  "use_case": "Use this guest incident time-ordered tracking when staff must document guest account and scene condition. Reconcile witness, immediate response, evidence custody, and follow-up before the guest incident handoff. Use the guest statement, witness contacts, scene photographs, camera-footage custody reference, first-response log, security report, property action, claim route, and follow-up call. Ask the assigned guest incident reviewer to confirm guest account against the organization's policy.",
